{
  "book": "omni",
  "bookName": "Omni",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 511.807,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it came to pass that I, Omni, being commanded by my father, Jarom, that I should write somewhat upon these plates,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 8.168,
      "end": 10.258,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to preserve our genealogy\u2014",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.938,
      "end": 19.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, in my days, I would that ye should know that I fought much with the sword to preserve my people, the Nephites,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 19.942,
      "end": 23.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from falling into the hands of their enemies, the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 23.884,
      "end": 26.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I of myself am a wicked man,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 26.665,
      "end": 31.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have not kept the statutes and the commandments of the Lord as I ought to have done.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 32.639,
      "end": 36.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that two hundred and seventy and six years had passed away,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 36.999,
      "end": 39.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we had many seasons of peace;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 39.594,
      "end": 42.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we had many seasons of serious war and bloodshed.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 42.839,
      "end": 47.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and in fine, two hundred and eighty and two years had passed away,",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 47.338,
      "end": 51.239,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I had kept these plates according to the commandments of my fathers;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 51.419,
      "end": 53.927,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I conferred them upon my son Amaron.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 54.107,
      "end": 55.314,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I make an end.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 55.994,
      "end": 60.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Amaron, write the things whatsoever I write,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 60.446,
      "end": 63.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are few, in the book of my father.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 63.68,
      "end": 67.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it came to pass that three hundred and twenty years had passed away,",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 67.9,
      "end": 70.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the more wicked part of the Nephites were destroyed.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 71.645,
      "end": 73.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the Lord would not suffer,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 73.775,
      "end": 77.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after he had led them out of the land of Jerusalem",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 77.67,
      "end": 82.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and kept and preserved them from falling into the hands of their enemies,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 82.308,
      "end": 86.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he would not suffer that the words should not be verified,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 86.807,
      "end": 89.686,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake unto our fathers, saying that:",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 89.866,
      "end": 92.56,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Inasmuch as ye will not keep my commandments",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 92.74,
      "end": 94.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall not prosper in the land.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 95.649,
      "end": 99.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the Lord did visit them in great judgment;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 100.055,
      "end": 104.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, he did spare the righteous that they should not perish,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 104.415,
      "end": 108.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but did deliver them out of the hands of their enemies.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 108.95,
      "end": 113.501,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I did deliver the plates unto my brother Chemish.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 114.181,
      "end": 119.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I, Chemish, write what few things I write, in the same book with my brother;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 119.33,
      "end": 124.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, I saw the last which he wrote, that he wrote it with his own hand;",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 124.433,
      "end": 127.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he wrote it in the day that he delivered them unto me.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 128.142,
      "end": 130.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner we keep the records,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 130.969,
      "end": 134.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is according to the commandments of our fathers.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 134.586,
      "end": 135.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I make an end.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 136.473,
      "end": 139.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I, Abinadom, am the son of Chemish.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 139.347,
      "end": 146.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it came to pass that I saw much war and contention between my people, the Nephites, and the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 146.818,
      "end": 153.738,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I, with my own sword, have taken the lives of many of the Lamanites in the defence of my brethren.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 154.418,
      "end": 158.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the record of this people is engraven upon plates",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 158.824,
      "end": 162.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is had by the kings, according to the generations;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 162.394,
      "end": 166.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I know of no revelation save that which has been written,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 166.243,
      "end": 167.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither prophecy;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 167.77,
      "end": 170.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, that which is sufficient is written.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 170.644,
      "end": 171.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I make an end.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 172.531,
      "end": 175.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am Amaleki, the son of Abinadom.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 175.683,
      "end": 183.021,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I will speak unto you somewhat concerning Mosiah, who was made king over the land of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 183.201,
      "end": 188.077,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, he being warned of the Lord that he should flee out of the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 188.257,
      "end": 191.415,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as many as would hearken unto the voice of the Lord",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 191.595,
      "end": 195.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should also depart out of the land with him, into the wilderness\u2014",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 196.594,
      "end": 201.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he did according as the Lord had commanded him.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 201.882,
      "end": 205.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they departed out of the land into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 205.313,
      "end": 208.285,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as many as would hearken unto the voice of the Lord;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 208.465,
      "end": 211.762,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were led by many preachings and prophesyings.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 211.942,
      "end": 215.1,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were admonished continually by the word of God;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 215.28,
      "end": 219.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were led by the power of his arm, through the wilderness",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 219.965,
      "end": 224.934,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they came down into the land which is called the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 225.614,
      "end": 230.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they discovered a people, who were called the people of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 230.206,
      "end": 233.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, there was great rejoicing among the people of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 233.869,
      "end": 236.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Zarahemla did rejoice exceedingly,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 236.928,
      "end": 243.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because the Lord had sent the people of Mosiah with the plates of brass which contained the record of the Jews.",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 244.063,
      "end": 251.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it came to pass that Mosiah discovered that the people of Zarahemla came out from Jerusalem at the time",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 251.534,
      "end": 256.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Zedekiah, king of Judah, was carried away captive into Babylon.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 256.765,
      "end": 258.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they journeyed in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 259.128,
      "end": 266.14,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were brought by the hand of the Lord across the great waters, into the land where Mosiah discovered them;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 266.32,
      "end": 269.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they had dwelt there from that time forth.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 269.972,
      "end": 272.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And at the time that Mosiah discovered them,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 272.985,
      "end": 275.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they had become exceedingly numerous.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 275.394,
      "end": 279.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they had had many wars and serious contentions,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 279.475,
      "end": 282.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had fallen by the sword from time to time;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 282.534,
      "end": 285.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their language had become corrupted;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 285.222,
      "end": 287.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they had brought no records with them;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 288.003,
      "end": 290.789,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they denied the being of their Creator;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 290.969,
      "end": 294.498,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Mosiah, nor the people of Mosiah, could understand them.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 295.178,
      "end": 300.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But it came to pass that Mosiah caused that they should be taught in his language.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 300.652,
      "end": 304.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after they were taught in the language of Mosiah,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 305.104,
      "end": 309.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Zarahemla gave a genealogy of his fathers, according to his memory;",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 309.464,
      "end": 312.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are written, but not in these plates.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 313.302,
      "end": 316.413,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 316.593,
      "end": 319.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of Mosiah, did unite together;",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 319.42,
      "end": 321.928,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Mosiah was appointed to be their king.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 322.608,
      "end": 325.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass in the days of Mosiah,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 325.389,
      "end": 329.336,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there was a large stone brought unto him with engravings on it;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 329.516,
      "end": 332.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he did interpret the engravings by the gift and power of God.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 333.586,
      "end": 336.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they gave an account of one Coriantumr,",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 336.599,
      "end": 338.503,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the slain of his people.",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 338.683,
      "end": 342.398,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Coriantumr was discovered by the people of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 342.578,
      "end": 345.736,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he dwelt with them for the space of nine moons.",
      "verse": "1:21",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 346.416,
      "end": 349.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "It also spake a few words concerning his fathers.",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 350.125,
      "end": 356.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And his first parents came out from the tower, at the time the Lord confounded the language of the people;",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 356.249,
      "end": 361.125,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the severity of the Lord fell upon them according to his judgments, which are just;",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 361.305,
      "end": 364.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their bones lay scattered in the land northward.",
      "verse": "1:22",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 365.236,
      "end": 368.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I, Amaleki, was born in the days of Mosiah;",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 368.899,
      "end": 371.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have lived to see his death;",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 371.262,
      "end": 374.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Benjamin, his son, reigneth in his stead.",
      "verse": "1:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 375.286,
      "end": 378.955,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I have seen, in the days of king Benjamin,",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 379.135,
      "end": 383.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a serious war and much bloodshed between the Nephites and the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 383.913,
      "end": 387.814,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the Nephites did obtain much advantage over them;",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 387.994,
      "end": 392.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, insomuch that king Benjamin did drive them out of the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "1:24",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 393.272,
      "end": 396.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I began to be old;",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 396.192,
      "end": 397.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and, having no seed,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 397.997,
      "end": 401.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and knowing king Benjamin to be a just man before the Lord,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 402.032,
      "end": 405.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I shall deliver up these plates unto him,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 405.556,
      "end": 408.203,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "exhorting all men to come unto God,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 408.383,
      "end": 409.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 410.096,
      "end": 411.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and believe in prophesying,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 412.087,
      "end": 413.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in revelations,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 413.846,
      "end": 416.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the ministering of angels,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 416.394,
      "end": 418.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the gift of speaking with tongues,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 419.035,
      "end": 421.821,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in the gift of interpreting languages,",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 422.001,
      "end": 424.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in all things which are good;",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 424.596,
      "end": 428.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there is nothing which is good save it comes from the Lord:",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 428.213,
      "end": 431.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that which is evil cometh from the devil.",
      "verse": "1:25",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 431.958,
      "end": 434.001,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 434.181,
      "end": 438.221,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should come unto Christ, who is the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 438.401,
      "end": 441.977,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and partake of his salvation, and the power of his redemption.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 442.157,
      "end": 443.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, come unto him,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 443.87,
      "end": 447.167,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and offer your whole souls as an offering unto him,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 447.347,
      "end": 449.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and continue in fasting and praying,",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 450.081,
      "end": 451.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and endure to the end;",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 451.794,
      "end": 454.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as the Lord liveth ye will be saved.",
      "verse": "1:26",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 454.889,
      "end": 458.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I would speak somewhat concerning a certain number",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 458.831,
      "end": 462.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who went up into the wilderness to return to the land of Nephi;",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 463.144,
      "end": 468.856,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for there was a large number who were desirous to possess the land of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "1:27",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 469.536,
      "end": 472.462,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, they went up into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 472.642,
      "end": 475.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And their leader being a strong and mighty man,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 475.562,
      "end": 477.327,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and a stiffnecked man,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 477.507,
      "end": 480.526,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore he caused a contention among them;",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 480.706,
      "end": 484.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were all slain, save fifty, in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 484.741,
      "end": 487.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they returned again to the land of Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "1:28",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 488.393,
      "end": 493.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they also took others to a considerable number,",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 493.589,
      "end": 496.84,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and took their journey again into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "1:29",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 497.52,
      "end": 501.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Amaleki, had a brother, who also went with them;",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 501.462,
      "end": 504.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have not since known concerning them.",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 504.336,
      "end": 506.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I am about to lie down in my grave;",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 506.977,
      "end": 508.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and these plates are full.",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 508.968,
      "end": 511.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I make an end of my speaking.",
      "verse": "1:30",
      "lineIndex": 145
    }
  ]
}